[For "white"]
[Kind "rare"]
[Start "london-main 1.d4"]
[Name "1...f5: the Dutch"]

1... f5 { The Dutch: Black grabs e4 with a pawn, but weakens e5 and the king's cover. [%csl Ye5] }
2. Bf4 { Aims straight at e5, the square the f-pawn has given up. }
2... Nf6
3. e3
3... e6
4. Nf3
4... Be7
5. Bd3 { Looks at the f5 pawn and the kingside behind it. }
5... O-O
6. h3 { Gives the bishop a retreat on h2. } *
